<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Factory Card started as strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Factory Card started as strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of Factory Card Outlet Corp as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Factory Card gained 1/2 to 9-1/2 in early morning trading.</p>
